### 创建用户
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test",
  "email": "1test@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 查询所有用户
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### 查询单个用户
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/cmwu3u5x20000er3ge07qznoq

### 更新用户
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/cmwu3u5x20000er3ge07qznoq
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "lyr",
  "email": "lyr@qq.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:8888/api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "cmkyoxflr00004ck82ywc6joi"
}
